OBP.MDL version history
-----------------------

-- Version 2.2
First saved version. Used with BLP version 2.2.

-- Version 3.1
Used with BLP version 3.1. Default instruction length changed from 10 to 3 to
work with the len microinstruction length analyser program.

Added the following instructions:

	Mc>>
	Mc>Mc
	Mc<0
	Mc<1
	Mc<Mc
	<Mc
	cmpQ
	E->Q
	L<>cmp

Renamed 0>Mc to Mn>Mc.

-- Version 3.2
Used with BLP version 3.2. No changes from 3.1.

-- Version 4.1
Used with BLP versions 3.3, 3.4, and 4.1.

Added the following instructions:

	0->Q
	cmpL<>
